%%{init: {'theme':'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (client1.com)
    participant Auth0 as Auth0 (IDP)
    participant PEP as Express Server (PEP)
    participant Cerbos as Cerbos (PDP)
    participant Storage as File System (Storage)
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI (LLM/Embeddings)

    Note over User, Auth0: Authentication Phase
    User->>Auth0: Login Request
    Auth0-->>User: ID Token (includes email & roles)
    User->>PEP: HTTP Request (with Session/Token)

    Note over PEP: Tenant Detection
    PEP->>PEP: Extract tenantId (e.g., "client1.com")
    
    Note over PEP, Cerbos: Authorization Phase (ABAC/RBAC)
    PEP->>Cerbos: checkResources (Principal: roles+tenantId, Resource: id+tenantId)
    Note right of Cerbos: Match P.attr.tenantId == R.attr.tenantId
    Cerbos-->>PEP: Allow / Deny Actions (read, delete, analyze, etc.)

    alt is Authorized
        Note over PEP, Storage: Resource Access
        PEP->>Storage: Read files from /storage/client1.com/
        Storage-->>PEP: Return Tenant JSON files
        
        opt Run AI RAG Analysis
            PEP->>OpenAI: Send tenant-specific data for Embeddings
            OpenAI-->>PEP: Return Vectors
            PEP->>OpenAI: Query GPT-4o for Summary
            OpenAI-->>PEP: Return Analysis
            PEP->>Storage: Save summary to /storage/client1.com/
        end
        
        PEP-->>User: Render Dashboard (only client1.com data)
    else is Forbidden
        PEP-->>User: 403 Forbidden
    end